{"masters":[{"name":"王羲之","zi":"逸少","dynasty":"东晋","style":"行 / 草","tagline":"书圣在此，且随我写一段风流","intro":"后世尊为“书圣”。行书《兰亭序》遒媚劲健，草书《十七帖》气象超然。本小程序所用皆为宋拓善本。","avatar":"images/masters/01_head.png","color":"#4a6d8c"},{"name":"欧阳询","zi":"信本","dynasty":"唐","style":"楷书","tagline":"一笔一画，皆有法度","intro":"楷法之冠，世称“欧体”。《九成宫醴泉铭》法度森严、险劲秀拔，是初学楷书公认的第一范本。","avatar":"images/masters/02_head.png","color":"#3d6b85"},{"name":"颜真卿","zi":"清臣","dynasty":"唐","style":"楷 / 行","tagline":"字如其人，先立正气","intro":"颜体开创者，雄浑刚正。《多宝塔碑》端整，《颜勤礼碑》宽博，《祭侄文稿》悲愤苍茫。","avatar":"images/masters/03_head.png","color":"#a83c32"},{"name":"柳公权","zi":"诚悬","dynasty":"唐","style":"楷书","tagline":"心正则笔正","intro":"柳体创始人，与颜并称“颜筋柳骨”。《玄秘塔碑》骨力遒健、清劲挺拔。","avatar":"images/masters/04_head.png","color":"#417057"},{"name":"赵孟頫","zi":"子昂","dynasty":"元","style":"行 / 楷","tagline":"圆熟流美，复古开新","intro":"元代书坛盟主，倡“复古”、追晋唐。《前后赤壁赋》写一赋二帖，圆润遒丽，是松雪体行书的代表。","avatar":"images/masters/05_head.png","color":"#527f9b"},{"name":"苏轼","zi":"子瞻","dynasty":"宋","style":"行书","tagline":"我书意造本无法","intro":"宋四家之首，尚“意”。《黄州寒食诗卷》沉郁顿挫，被誉为“天下第三行书”。","avatar":"images/masters/06_head.png","color":"#a2702f"},{"name":"米芾","zi":"元章","dynasty":"宋","style":"行书","tagline":"八面出锋，沉着痛快","intro":"“米颠”也。八面出锋、沉着痛快，自谓“刷字”。《英光堂帖》为宋刻汇帖，米书面目最全。","avatar":"images/masters/07_head.png","color":"#3a4f5e"},{"name":"怀素","zi":"藏真","dynasty":"唐","style":"草书","tagline":"笔走龙蛇，满纸云烟","intro":"“草圣”也。以狂继颠，奔蛇走虺。《自叙帖》纵横不羁、满纸云烟，狂草极则。","avatar":"images/masters/08_head.png","color":"#7a6a58"},{"name":"曹全碑","zi":"景完","dynasty":"汉","style":"隶书","tagline":"蚕头燕尾，秀润典丽","intro":"东汉隶书名碑，秀润典丽、蚕头燕尾。《曹全碑》是习隶最温润平和的入门范本。","avatar":"images/masters/09_head.png","color":"#8a7330"},{"name":"李斯","zi":"通古","dynasty":"秦","style":"篆书","tagline":"书同文，篆法森严","intro":"助秦始皇“书同文”，小篆之祖。《峄山碑》线条圆融、法度森严，是篆书入门正途。","avatar":"images/masters/10_head.png","color":"#4a4450"},{"name":"褚遂良","zi":"登善","dynasty":"唐","style":"楷书","tagline":"清远萧散，瘦劲丰神","intro":"唐初名臣、太宗侍书。《雁塔圣教序》瘦劲飘逸，把初唐楷书从方正推向疏朗丰秀。","avatar":"images/masters/11_head.png","color":"#5c6f70"}],"steles":[{"id":"caoquan","master":"caoquan","title":"曹全碑","cover":"images/steles/caoquan/caoquan/thumbs/01.jpg","hero":"images/steles/caoquan/caoquan/01.jpg","count":8},{"id":"yanta","master":"chusuiliang","title":"雁塔圣教序","cover":"images/steles/chusuiliang/yanta/thumbs/01.jpg","hero":"images/steles/chusuiliang/yanta/01.jpg","count":8},{"id":"zixu","master":"huaisu","title":"自叙帖卷","cover":"images/steles/huaisu/zixu/thumbs/01.jpg","hero":"images/steles/huaisu/zixu/01.jpg","count":10},{"id":"yishan","master":"lisi","title":"峄山碑","cover":"images/steles/lisi/yishan/thumbs/01.jpg","hero":"images/steles/lisi/yishan/01.jpg","count":8},{"id":"xuanmita","master":"liugongquan","title":"玄秘塔碑","cover":"images/steles/liugongquan/xuanmita/thumbs/01.jpg","hero":"images/steles/liugongquan/xuanmita/01.jpg","count":8},{"id":"yingguangtang","master":"mifei","title":"英光堂帖","cover":"images/steles/mifei/yingguangtang/thumbs/01.jpg","hero":"images/steles/mifei/yingguangtang/01.jpg","count":8},{"id":"jiuchenggong","master":"ouyangxun","title":"九成宫醴泉铭","cover":"images/steles/ouyangxun/jiuchenggong/thumbs/01.jpg","hero":"images/steles/ouyangxun/jiuchenggong/01.jpg","count":8},{"id":"hanshi","master":"sushi","title":"黄州寒食诗卷（寒食帖）","cover":"images/steles/sushi/hanshi/thumbs/01.jpg","hero":"images/steles/sushi/hanshi/01.jpg","count":8},{"id":"qishitie","master":"wangxizhi","title":"十七帖","cover":"images/steles/wangxizhi/qishitie/thumbs/01.jpg","hero":"images/steles/wangxizhi/qishitie/01.jpg","count":8},{"id":"shengjiaoxu","master":"wangxizhi","title":"集王羲之圣教序","cover":"images/steles/wangxizhi/shengjiaoxu/thumbs/01.jpg","hero":"images/steles/wangxizhi/shengjiaoxu/01.jpg","count":10},{"id":"duobaota","master":"yanzhenqing","title":"多宝塔碑","cover":"images/steles/yanzhenqing/duobaota/thumbs/01.jpg","hero":"images/steles/yanzhenqing/duobaota/01.jpg","count":8},{"id":"yanqinli","master":"yanzhenqing","title":"颜勤礼碑","cover":"images/steles/yanzhenqing/yanqinli/thumbs/01.jpg","hero":"images/steles/yanzhenqing/yanqinli/01.jpg","count":8},{"id":"chibifu","master":"zhaomengfu","title":"前后赤壁赋册","cover":"images/steles/zhaomengfu/chibifu/thumbs/01.jpg","hero":"images/steles/zhaomengfu/chibifu/01.jpg","count":6}],"quotes":[{"text":"用笔在心，心正则笔正。","from":"唐 · 柳公权（《旧唐书》笔谏）"},{"text":"初学分布，但求平正；既知平正，务追险绝；既能险绝，复归平正。","from":"唐 · 孙过庭《书谱》"},{"text":"临书易失古人位置，而多得古人笔意；摹书易得古人位置，而多失古人笔意。","from":"宋 · 姜夔《续书谱》"},{"text":"书之妙道，神彩为上，形质次之。","from":"南朝 · 王僧虔《笔意赞》"},{"text":"夫书肇于自然，自然既立，阴阳生焉。","from":"汉 · 蔡邕《九势》"},{"text":"取法乎上，仅得乎中。","from":"唐 · 李世民《帝范》"},{"text":"书，如也。如其学，如其才，如其志，总之曰如其人而已。","from":"清 · 刘熙载《艺概》"},{"text":"意在笔前，然后作字。","from":"传 王羲之《题卫夫人〈笔阵图〉后》"}]}